---
import Layout from '~/layouts/PageLayout.astro';
const metadata = { title: 'Privacy Policy — Taiwanese Gods', ignoreTitleTemplate: true };
---

<Layout metadata={metadata}>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-12">
    <div class="text-center mb-12">
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-serif font-bold text-red-900 dark:text-red-300 mb-4 tracking-wide">
        Privacy Policy
      </h1>
      <div class="w-24 h-1 bg-gold-300 mx-auto mb-6"></div>
      <p class="text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 text-sm">Last updated: February 2025</p>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-8 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
      <section class="bg-white/80 dark:bg-gray-800/80 p-8 rounded-lg border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-serif font-bold text-red-900 dark:text-red-300 mb-4">1. Data Collection</h2>
        <p class="mb-3">
          Taiwanese Gods values your privacy. This policy explains how we collect, use, and protect your personal
          information.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-3">
          We do not collect any personally identifiable information during general browsing. We may only collect
          information you voluntarily provide in the following circumstances:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">
          <li>Name and email address provided when contacting us via email or contact forms</li>
          <li>Content suggestions or contributions you submit to us</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="bg-white/80 dark:bg-gray-800/80 p-8 rounded-lg border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-serif font-bold text-red-900 dark:text-red-300 mb-4">2. Cookies & Tracking</h2>
        <p class="mb-3">This website uses the following technologies to optimize your browsing experience:</p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 mb-3">
          <li>
            <strong>Essential Cookies</strong> — Used to remember your language preference (Chinese/English/Japanese) and
            dark mode setting
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Local Storage</strong> — Used to store temporary states for interactive features (moon blocks, fortune
            sticks)
          </li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          These technologies do not collect personally identifiable information. You can manage or disable cookies in
          your browser settings, though this may affect some features.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="bg-white/80 dark:bg-gray-800/80 p-8 rounded-lg border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-serif font-bold text-red-900 dark:text-red-300 mb-4">3. Third-Party Services</h2>
        <p class="mb-3">
          This website may use or embed the following third-party services, each with their own privacy policies:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 mb-3">
          <li><strong>Google Analytics</strong> — Used for anonymous traffic and usage analytics</li>
          <li><strong>Google Maps</strong> — Used for temple location navigation</li>
          <li><strong>Vercel</strong> — Website hosting service that may collect access logs</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          We recommend reviewing the privacy policies of these services for details on their data handling practices.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="bg-white/80 dark:bg-gray-800/80 p-8 rounded-lg border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-serif font-bold text-red-900 dark:text-red-300 mb-4">4. Data Usage & Protection</h2>
        <p class="mb-3">Personal information you provide (such as email) is used only for:</p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 mb-3">
          <li>Responding to your inquiries, suggestions, or contributions</li>
          <li>Processing collaboration proposals or licensing requests</li>
          <li>Improving website content and service quality</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          We will not sell, trade, or otherwise transfer your personal information to third parties without your
          explicit consent, unless required by law. We employ reasonable security measures to protect collected
          information.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="bg-white/80 dark:bg-gray-800/80 p-8 rounded-lg border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-serif font-bold text-red-900 dark:text-red-300 mb-4">5. Your Rights</h2>
        <p class="mb-3">You have the right to:</p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 mb-3">
          <li>Access personal information we hold about you</li>
          <li>Request correction of inaccurate information</li>
          <li>Request deletion of your personal information</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          To exercise these rights, please contact us at <a
            href="mailto:taiwanese.gods@gmail.com"
            class="text-red-700 dark:text-red-400 hover:underline">taiwanese.gods@gmail.com</a
          >.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="bg-white/80 dark:bg-gray-800/80 p-8 rounded-lg border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-serif font-bold text-red-900 dark:text-red-300 mb-4">6. Policy Changes</h2>
        <p>
          This privacy policy may be updated periodically. Significant changes will be announced on this page with the
          updated date. We recommend reviewing this page regularly.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="bg-white/80 dark:bg-gray-800/80 p-8 rounded-lg border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-serif font-bold text-red-900 dark:text-red-300 mb-4">7. Contact</h2>
        <p>
          If you have any privacy-related questions or concerns, please email us at <a
            href="mailto:taiwanese.gods@gmail.com"
            class="text-red-700 dark:text-red-400 hover:underline">taiwanese.gods@gmail.com</a
          >.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12 text-center">
      <a
        href="/en"
        class="inline-block px-6 py-3 bg-gray-100 dark:bg-gray-700 hover:bg-gray-200 dark:hover:bg-gray-600 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 rounded-lg transition-colors font-medium"
      >
        Back to Home
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
